'''Multiversal Studios''' is the sixth and final stage in [[Walk of Fame]]. [[Inumusha]] and the [[Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Doge Base]] debut here. Upon completion, players have a 30% chance to unlock [[Miyamoku Musashi (Special Cat)|Miyamoku Musashi]] (guaranteed if a Treasure Radar is used).

